2026-08-16T13:14:58Z    [ADI:Adjusted diluted EPS] GATE critic: The proposed Adjusted diluted EPS of $3.54062 for ADI in FY2026Q3 exceeds the company’s stated guidance range of $3.30 ± $0.15 (i.e., $3.15–$3.45). It is $0.09062 above the top end ($3.45), about 2.6% over the guided high, contradicting the provided guidance for that specific period and basis.
2026-08-16T13:15:03Z    [HD:Comparable sales, total company] GATE critic: The math shown for the “weighted blend” doesn’t produce the proposed 1.00023%. Using your own inputs and weights, 1.13333×0.901 + (−0.216667)×0.099 = 0.99968 (approx), not 1.00023. So the submitted figure is arithmetically too high versus the stated calculation.
