2026-08-16T13:16:00Z    [HAS:Pre-exceptional operating profit] GATE critic: You blended an FY2026 full‑year consensus (£45.2m, per your own source) with a “seasonal_trend” input of 25.742 that is not an FY2026 full‑year pre‑exceptional operating profit (it appears to be a partial‑period/seasonal run‑rate). That mixes different period bases and drags the result to 44.89, below the only cited FY2026 figure. On the specified basis (FY2026, pre‑exceptional, GBPm), the forecast should anchor to the £45.2m consensus rather than a partial‑period seasonal number.
